        "Byggnadskategori": {
          "label": "type of building",
          "note": [
            "At the general assessment of real estate in 2005 two new categories of farm buildings were introduced. Stable for cattle was divided into the categories stable for dairy cows and stable for cattle to be slaughted. Stable for fowls and chickens was divided into stable for fowls and stable for broilers and turkeys. For most of the categories of building the classification was changed so that the category other farm buildings should include buildings with year of construction before 1980. At the general assessment in 1998 the year of construction should be before 1970",
            "At the general assessment of real estate in 2005 two new categories of farm buildings were introduced. Stable for cattle was divided into the categories stable for dairy cows and stable for cattle to be slaughted. Stable for fowls and chickens was divided into stable for fowls and stable for broilers and turkeys. For most of the categories of building the classification was changed so that the category other farm buildings should include buildings with year of construction before 1980. At the general assessment in 1998 the year of construction should be before 1970"
